From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: suvojeet-sengupta <suvojitsengupta21@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 09:52:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Settings: Add Play Integrity Fix import

Port PenguinOS PlayIntegrityFix: a Play Integrity Fix screen under More
security & privacy to import a pif.json (written to Settings.Secure.
PIF_DATA, which PIHooks already reads), toggle PIF off, and fetch/random
update. Strings kept in their own pif_strings.xml; the Penguin-server
fetch URL (config_pifUpdateUrl) is left empty.

Change-Id: Ic7f6ac695c8a047a4b7a7877c745df5fe8a15909
